        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Bands: Lush, P.O.D.\n- People: Miki Berenyi, Emma Anderson, Phil King, Chris Acland, Sonny Sandoval, Wuv Bernardo, Marcos Curiel, Traa Daniels\n- Places: London, San Diego, California\n- Genres: Rock, Christian nu metal\n\nFacts:\n- Lush were an English rock band formed in London in 1987.\n- P.O.D., short for Payable on Death, is a Christian nu metal band formed in 1992 and based in San Diego, California.\n- Before Lush's original split, Lush's lineup consisted of Miki Berenyi on vocals and guitar, Emma Anderson on vocals and guitar, Phil King on bass, and Chris Acland on drums.\n- P.O.D.'s lineup consists of vocalist Sonny Sandoval, drummer Wuv Bernardo, guitarist Marcos Curiel, and bassist Traa Daniels.",
